Description:

sieveshell has a new ``--tls`` option to use STARTTLS, verifying the server
certificate, with ``--cafile`` and ``--capath`` to trust extra CAs.  The
Cyrus::SIEVE::managesieve ``sieve_get_handle`` function takes the same
settings as optional arguments.


Documentation:

sieveshell(1), Cyrus::SIEVE::managesieve


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

None.  Without ``--tls``, sieveshell behaves as before.


